\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  arm raised above head\
NG tube placement 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  high fowlers\
Tube feeding with decreased LOC 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  put on right side (promotes emptying of\
stomach) with HOB elevated (prevent aspiration)\
