\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  low semi-fowlers\
After myringotomy 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  lay on affected ear (allows drainage)\
After cataract surgery 
\f1 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  lay on unaffected side\
